# Meadow School

Private family PA home-ed app (Expo web + iOS). Learners ages 3–7. Read root `AGENTS.md` before large changes.

## Must follow

- Keep Meadow tutor FAB on every lesson screen; answers grounded only in lesson `groundingText` + exercises.
- New lessons go in `content/bands/*.ts` with PA tags from `content/pa-alignment.ts`.
- Use `lib/theme.ts` (Storybook Meadow). No purple gradients; no cream+terracotta cliché; no Inter/Roboto defaults.
- Child surfaces: large tap targets, short copy, reading/math/drawing exercises.
- Parent changes behind PIN (`app/parent`).

## Prefer

- Extending schema + band content over one-off hardcoded screens.
- Local `askMeadow` / `answerFromLesson` over network calls for kid chat.
